<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="description" content="Orofoods — distribuição B2B para hamburguerias e food service."/><title>@ViewData["Title"] · Orofoods</title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Manrope:wght@600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/site.css" asp-append-version="true"/></head>
<body><header class="site-header"><nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg"><div class="container"><a class="brand" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index"><span class="brand-mark">O</span><span>ORO<small>FOODS</small></span></a><button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#mainNav"><span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span></button><div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="mainNav"><ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto align-items-lg-center gap-lg-2"><li><a class="nav-link" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index">Início</a></li><li><a class="nav-link" asp-controller="Portal" asp-action="Catalog">Produtos</a></li><li><a class="nav-link" href="/#sobre">Sobre nós</a></li><li><a class="nav-link" href="/#como-funciona">Como funciona</a></li><li><a class="btn btn-outline-dark ms-lg-2" asp-area="Identity" asp-page="/Account/Login">Entrar</a></li><li><a class="btn btn-gold" asp-controller="Portal" asp-action="Dashboard">Área do cliente</a></li></ul></div></div></nav></header><main>@RenderBody()</main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="container d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between gap-3"><div class="brand brand-light"><span class="brand-mark">O</span><span>ORO<small>FOODS</small></span></div><p>Distribuição inteligente para quem leva hambúrguer a sério.</p><p>© 2026 Orofoods</p></div></footer><script src="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script><script src="~/js/site.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>@await RenderSectionAsync("Scripts", required: false)</body></html>
